(i)	Operating a Private Financing Platform.

The Fund Manager, or the Person proposing to be the Fund Manager, of a Domestic Fund which is a Public Fund that is an Umbrella Fund, who is applying to register the Fund, must pay to the Regulator:
(a)	an application fee of $6,000 in respect of the Umbrella Fund and its first Sub-Fund; and
